how.\nRecorded in England from April 1983-November 1986.\nCover Star: Shelagh Delaney, reprinted from the Saturday Evening Post.\nReleased under licence from Rough Trade Records, England.\n\nRegarding the \"vamp\" credit, Marr has stated \"On 'Ask'... I'm also vamping on a 'G' harmonica through a Urei Boom Box\".\n\nRunouts are etched except Kdisc and the SRC logo.\n\nAs identified by their specific pattern inside the runout matrices:\n- Lacquer cut (at/by) derived from 'Kdisc L'\n- Plating derived from stamped [SRC logo], the Sheffield Lab Matrix delta number and the [Allied 'ɑ' logo], sometimes along with the per-side pressing order numbers 'B-#####'.","images":[{"uri":"https://i.discogs.com/NSKKm0YBUW7N3PV7Z0vPNh10R-V9pkkwaF7wPGT4sQA/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:597/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9SLTU2NjIy/NjAtMTM5OTI1NTU0/NS04NzA5LmpwZWc.jpeg","width":600,"height":597,"type":"primary"},{"uri":"https://i.discogs.com/HpxXW0SQW0jAQbkoGpPB3G56QNmPoZOwpkiwvNf6MR4/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:590/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9SLTU2NjIy/NjAtMTU4MDU0MTA5/My04MjYzLmpwZWc.jpeg","width":590,"height":600,"type":"secondary"},{"uri":"https://i.discogs.com/tY2-JQt_rmuvImBdUnta9Dqt75ItZd7Ro8ALl06Qbh8/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:595/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9SLTU2NjIy/NjAtMTU4MDU0MTA5/My03MjE0LmpwZWc.jpeg","width":595,"height":600,"type":"secondary"},{"uri":"https://i.discogs.com/MapqtREE17DMo7cxI4lmhzuiEVpVwi6iXXrI04dee5w/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:596/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9SLTU2NjIy/NjAtMTM5OTI1NTU1/Mi0zNDc3LmpwZWc.jpeg","width":600,"height":596,"type":"secondary"},{"uri":"https://i.discogs.com/kKj8--zpQfP-jRAa4nG7YfbkPIzCtoPcGjCgygtuE94/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:595/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9SLTU2NjIy/NjAtMTM5OTI1NTU1/OC0yNzc4LmpwZWc.jpeg","width":595,"height":600,"type":"secondary"},{"uri":"https://i.discogs.com/KNS1GIgZVZ56hBZC4IW5LIPtPGggWyez-f4MPu2O18s/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:596/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YW